> Module Date_rounding_mod

A module whose scopes and function add one month to a date, with or without
a rounding mode of their own.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope NoRounding:
  input d content date
  output r content date

declaration scope RoundDown:
  input d content date
  output r content date

declaration add_one_month content date
  depends on d content date
  equals d + 1 month
```

```catala
scope NoRounding:
  definition r equals d + 1 month

scope RoundDown:
  date round down
  definition r equals d + 1 month
```
